    "detailed_description": "ABOUT:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMeteoStorm is an action packed retro shoot-em-up.  MeteoStorm offers up to 25 challenging waves of exciting shoot-em-up action with 3 different difficulty levels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Iidrok have initiated their plot to annihilate the human settlement on Lodone VI.  You are the pilot of the Storm the only force that can stand in their way and thwart their evil plans!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle through wave after wave of meteors flying on their way toward the surface of planet Lodone VI.  With each wave of meteors the Iidrok have squadrons of scouts, fighters, and their capital ships ready and waiting to jump in and attack!  Dodge meteors, alien ships, and their weaponry to achieve victory!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMeteoStorm runs on Windows or Mac OS X and supports keyboard and gamepad controls.  Players can customize their controls through the Options menu.  MeteoStorm also maintains a high scores table for players to track their skill through the game in retro style.",
